      95.85,
      503.65,
      539.85,
      526.72
    ],
    "text": "1.These rules may be cited as the Rules on recruitment, appointment, transfer, promotion and disciplinarycontrol of Police Officers, approved by the Commission on May 08, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      95.85,
      539.65,
      539.92,
      574.72
    ],
    "text": "2.The National Police Commission when appointing chairperson/s and members to the interview panels forthe recruitment/ appointment/ selection of candidates to the posts of Police Officers may appoint achairperson/ s to chair such Panels.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      95.85,
      587.65,
      539.94,
      610.72
    ],
    "text": "3.The Rule in (2) above shall apply to the recruitment and appointment of Police Officers, notwithstanding anyexisting rules or rules of procedure to the contrary.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
